  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2022;	Advice to guide the strategy for an activity or component workstream and feed into adaptive management of each component.  
&#x2022;	Make independent assessments against outputs and outcomes set in the log-frame, including on aligning delivery of cross-cutting objectives on federalism and inclusion.
&#x2022;	Provide advice on where to scale up, down or close existing activities and when to start new workstreams.</narrative>
  </description>
